{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Of the keepers of the threshold.</b> In the inner court. And Scripture did not mention why they were enraged, and how Mordecai knew the matter. Some say that he was of the Sanhedrin and knew seventy languages, and this is the meaning of 'Mordecai the interpreter' [belashon], but the meaning of belashon is only a single man."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:48.534326501Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}